ur theme, event, and friend colours. It’s cleaner, sleeker, and looking better than ever.\n\nAnd because we know you love to keep your life in sync, we’ve got another massive update for you: you can now directly sync your Google Calendar to Howbout! No more switching back and forth between apps to see when you’re actually free.","trackCensoredName":"Howbout: shared calendar","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/howbout-shared-calendar/id1477248221?uo=4","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.72903,"artistId":1477248220,"artistName":"Howbout Ltd.","price":0.0,"sellerUrl":"https://howbout.app","languageCodesISO2A":["EN"],"fileSizeBytes":"170852352","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1395,"trackContentRating":"12+","releaseDate":"2019-11-30T08:00:00Z","primaryGenreName":"Social Networking","primaryGenreId":6005,"genreIds":["6005","6007"],"currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-07-31T20:16:02Z","trackId":1477248221,"trackName":"Howbout: shared calendar","sellerName":"Howbout Ltd.","isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"version":"16.0.3","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"The shared calendar for friends, couples, and family\n\nThis is the app you’ve seen all over TikTok. 10M downloads, 200M+ plans made, and 1B+ views across social media. Howbout is how millions of people actually see each other more. \n\nPlanning shouldn't take a hundred messages and a \"when works for you?\" thread that goes nowhere. Howbout fixes that. Find the gap, lock in the plan, actually see the people who matter to you.\n\n…\n\nWHAT YOU CAN DO WITH HOWBOUT\n\nSEE WHEN EVERYONE'S FREE\nNo guessing, it's right there on the calendar.\n\nMAKE PLANS\nAdd events, add details, and keep everything together, so plans don't fall apart.\n\nSHARE YOUR CALENDAR OR AVAILABILITY\nChoose what people see. Stay private or share with friends.\n\nKEEP ALL THE DETAILS IN ONE PLACE\nPlans, chats, locations, notes, photos… no switching apps or losing the details.\n\nREAL TIME NOTIFICATIONS\nGet updates when plans change or when your friends are up to something fun.\n\nMAKE YOUR CALENDAR YOURS\nColor-code and customize your calendar how you like.\n\nSYNC YOUR CALENDARS & TIMELINES\nWork, school, personal, social… it's all in one place, so nothing clashes.\n\nUP NEXT WIDGETS\nStay on top of your upcoming plans and see what your friends are up to from your home screen.\n\n…\n\nBUILT FOR REAL LIFE\n\nFor friend groups: check availability, lock in plans, actually see each other more.\n\nFor couples: stay in sync, plan dates faster, stop double-booking each other.\n\nFor families: track school runs, appointments, and weekends, all in one place.\n\n…\n\nHOWBOUT+\n\nUnlock more customization like colors and app themes, smarter planning tools, and get an all around better experience.\n\nYour subscription will automatically renew unless turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage your subscription in your App Store settings.\n\n…\n\nContact us: support@howbout.app · Follow @howbout_app\nPrivacy: howbout.app/privacy · Terms: howbout.app/terms","contentAdvisoryRating":"12+","minimumOsVersion":"16.0","averageUserRating":4.72903,"genres":["Social Networking","Productivity"],"userRatingCount":1395}